      "raw": "<p>I was doing a Vengeance matchup - Prime Wardens Fanatic, &nbsp;Bunker (Engine of War) and Dark Watch Mr. Fixer fighting Proletariat, Friction and Ermine - and came across an interesting interaction I hadn&#39;t seen before. &nbsp;I was using Prime Warden Fanatic&#39;s power - you take damage, &nbsp;play a card, &nbsp;and anyone can use a power - and she pulled Prayer of Desperation out. &nbsp;I know normally when you play it on your turn it ends things right away, &nbsp;but this was the powers phase and I was allowed to still trigger a power use. &nbsp;Not sure if this was intentional or there&#39;s something about doing this not in your card play phase that treat turns a bit differently (maybe your turn is already over, or the power use triggers retroactively because the Power was used before the card took effect?) I guess it&#39;s a bit of &quot;how immediately is immediately&quot;.</p>",
