      "created_at": "2017-02-20T18:53:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The same thing will happen if, say, you use Don't Dismiss Anything and Scholar puts Know When to Hold Fast into play. He draws five, the rest of DDA resolves, and then he ends his turn.</p>",
