      "raw": "<p>To be clear, &quot;end your turn&quot; means &quot;go to your end-of-turn phase&quot;; so your turn isn&#39;t done, but you may skip one or more of your previous phases.</p><p>&quot;skip the rest of your turn&quot;, however stops everything and immediately goes to the next turn. You see this on Meteor Storm, for example.</p>",
